 * the 3D view through the TLAS, showing albedo, normals, material kinds,
 * instances, vis clusters or the motion since the last frame of what it
 * hits. In albedo mode, a second ray query walks the effects TLAS up to
 * that hit and blends the particles and sprites in front of it over it,
 * as Quake II RTX's path tracer does.
